{"ratings":[{"id":"F1","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"plausible","reason":"A realistic documentation glob can match an unintended file and cause the factory to skip tests that should run."},{"id":"F2","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"plausible","reason":"A repository mixing conventional test names with Bun-supported underscore names can silently skip a failing documentation test."},{"id":"F3","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"plausible","reason":"A passing targeted run can be reported as fixing a failing full suite, leading a person or reviewer to rely on an unverified result."}]}